<title>USA: PHLX to trade Spectrian options from Aug 22.</title>
<headline>PHLX to trade Spectrian options from Aug 22.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange said Friday it would list options on Spectrian Corp on August 22.</p>
<p>The options will open with strike prices of 40, 45 and 50 and initial expirations in September, October, November and February. Position limits have been set at 7,500 contracts.</p>
<p>The specialist will be Group One Ltd.</p>
<p>The options will also be available at the American Stock Exchange and the Chicago Board Options Exchange.</p>
<p>((--Chicago derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: chicago.derivatives.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
